ESSAGE checksum. If the test"},{"k":"p","t":"does not pass, the factory ATTRACT"},{"k":"tr","t":"MODE   MESSAGE   is   restored."},{"k":"p","t":"Next, the game adjustments are"},{"k":"tr","t":"checked   and   restored   to   factory"},{"k":"p","t":"settings if an error is found. If game adjustments are found intact, the high score table is checked for any bad"},{"k":"p","t":"entries. Bad entries are replaced with a score of 4,000 points and no initials. If all entries check, the game returns to the Game Over Mode."},{"k":"p","t":"If game adjustments are restored to"},{"k":"tr","t":"factory   settings,   the   AUDIT"},{"k":"p","t":"TOTALS are checked. If 5 or more"},{"k":"p","t":"audit digits are other than 0-9 (that is hexadecimal A through F) all audit totals are cleared. This is followed"},{"k":"p","t":"by a check of the high score table and the table is reset to factory settings if errors are found. Finally, game adjustments are rechecked and either OPEN COIN DOOR or FACTORY"},{"k":"h","t":"SETTINGS RESTORED is"},{"k":"p","t":"displayed. With the former, open the coin door and turn the game OFF and"},{"k":"p","t":"ON and then FACTORY SETTINGS"},{"k":"tr","t":"RESTORED   will   be   displayed."},{"k":"p","t":"Return to game over by depressing the ADVANCE pushbutton or by turning the game OFF and ON a second time. APPENDIX A"},{"k":"p","t":"POWER ON oy) \u2014\u2014"},{"k":"p","t":"ATTRACT MODE MESSAGE? PASS."},{"k":"p","t":"\u00a5 FAIL"},{"k":"p","t":"RESTORE FACTORY MESSAGE"},{"k":"p","t":"PASS. GAME ADJUSTMENTS?"},{"k":"p","t":"FAIL"},{"k":"p","t":"RESTORE FACTORY SETTINGS"},{"k":"p","t":"{____]"},{"k":"p","t":"PASS, AUDITS?"},{"k":"p","t":"FAIL \u00a5__SORMORE HEX AF"},{"k":"p","t":"CLEAR AUDITS"},{"k":"p","t":"a"},{"k":"p","t":"HIGH PASS. SCORE TABLE?"},{"k":"p","t":"\u00a5 RESET HIGH SCORE TABLE \u2018TO FACOTRY SETTINGS FAIL,"},{"k":"p","t":"PASS. GAME ADJUSTMENTS?"},{"k":"p","t":"t"},{"k":"p","t":"\"OPEN COIN DOOR\" DISPLAYED FAIL,"},{"k":"p","t":"OPEN COIN DOOR POWER OFF AND ON oo HIGH SCORE ENTRIES?"},{"k":"p","t":"FAIL, \u00a5 Pass:"},{"k":"p","t":"BAD ENTRIES REPLACED WITH 4.000 AND NO INITIALS"},{"k":"p","t":"\u201cINITIAL TESTS INDICATE ALL SYSTEMS GO\" DISPLAYED"},{"k":"p","t":"\"FACTORY SETTINGS RESTORED\" DISPLAYED"},{"k":"p","t":"POWER ON AND OFF"},{"k":"p","t":"o__,__~"},{"k":"p","t":"Al"}]}